  "title": "Shiitake Angel Hair Pasta",
  "description": "Fresh shiitake mushrooms, sauteed in garlic and onion, is simmered in a reduction of wine, stock and cream, then tossed with delicate strands of angel hair pasta and served with a dusting of Parmesan and parsley.",
